 (swing low in, momentum turned up), but it's LATE \u2014 price is already extended above the cycle low (formed ~9 day(s) ago @ 119.12) and overbought (daily RSI 66, 3-day 73 & weekly 76). A momentum cross is a LAGGING confirmation: after a vertical run it only triggers once the move is mature, so the bottoming entry has already passed. This is a chase, not a fresh buy.", "next": "Don't initiate here. Wait for a pullback toward the 10-day average \u2014 or the next daily-cycle low to set up \u2014 for a lower-risk entry; hold if you're already long.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "neutral", "regime_label": "MIXED", "regime_why": "weekly momentum positive; 3-day crossed up; investor cycle overdue", "regime_score": 1.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: MIXED \u2014 weekly momentum positive; 3-day crossed up; investor cycle overdue (investor cycle week 59 \u00b7 daily cycle day 64).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a high. Bigger picture (no clear trend): mixed.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is mixed (no clear trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up"], "entry": {"tag": "DON'T CHASE", "tag_zh": "\u52ff\u8ffd\u9ad8", "urgency": "caution", "text": "You missed the bottoming entry \u2014 the low already formed and price is now extended (overbought (daily RSI 66, 3-day 73 & weekly 76)). Don't chase; wait for a pullback to the 10-day average or the next cycle low. Hold if already long.", "text_zh": "\u5df2\u9519\u8fc7\u7b51\u5e95\u5165\u573a\u2014\u2014\u4f4e\u70b9\u5df2\u7ecf\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u76ee\u524d\u4ef7\u683c\u5df2\u62c9\u4f38\uff08\u5df2\u8d85\u4e70\uff08\u65e5\u7ebf RSI 66\u30013 \u65e5 73 \u4e0e\u5468\u7ebf 76\uff09\uff09\u3002\u4e0d\u8981\u8ffd\u9ad8\uff1b\u7b49\u5f85\u56de\u8c03\u81f3 10 \u65e5\u5747\u7ebf\u6216\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9